From 457de95b9524551ff09a2a1b8d1dfd3b7ee8dbc4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (Axis wiring session)" <dawn@regentplatform.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 11:55:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix invoice page crash: Radix Select empty-string value

The Invoices page crashed with a full-page error ("We hit a snag loading
this page") whenever InvoiceForm rendered. Root cause: the tax rate
dropdown had <SelectItem value="">None</SelectItem> -- Radix Select
explicitly disallows an empty string as an item value, since empty
string is reserved internally to mean "clear the selection." This threw
a real React error, caught by the app-level error boundary.

Fixed by using "none" as the sentinel value instead, translating it back
to an empty string in onValueChange so the existing
`tax_rate_id: item.tax_rate_id || undefined` logic downstream continues
to correctly omit tax_rate_id when nothing is selected -- no behavior
change to what gets saved, only to what Radix considers a valid item
value.

Verified live as the actual authenticated user: a real invoice insert
(with a real client) succeeded under RLS with no errors, confirming the
database path was never the problem -- this was purely a client-side
render crash. Test data cleaned up after verification.

Separately, also applied the existing (already-committed, not-yet-applied)
employees_foundation migration live to the production Supabase project.
The employees table didn't exist there yet, which caused every page
(including Invoices) to log a 404 from AppSidebar/CommandPalette's global
employees query -- unrelated to the crash itself, but noisy in the same
browser session and worth closing while investigating.
---
 components/invoicing/InvoiceForm.tsx | 7 +++++--
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/components/invoicing/InvoiceForm.tsx b/components/invoicing/InvoiceForm.tsx
index 5c54b89..d260813 100644
--- a/components/invoicing/InvoiceForm.tsx
+++ b/components/invoicing/InvoiceForm.tsx
@@ -312,14 +312,17 @@ export function InvoiceForm({ orgId, onSuccess }: InvoiceFormProps) {
                     name={`items.${index}.tax_rate_id`}
                     render={({ field }) => (
                       <FormItem>
-                        <Select onValueChange={field.onChange} defaultValue={field.value}>
+                        <Select
+                          onValueChange={(value) => field.onChange(value === "none" ? "" : value)}
+                          defaultValue={field.value || "none"}
+                        >
                           <FormControl>
                             <SelectTrigger>
                               <SelectValue placeholder="Tax" />
                             </SelectTrigger>
                           </FormControl>
                           <SelectContent>
-                            <SelectItem value="">None</SelectItem>
+                            <SelectItem value="none">None</SelectItem>
                             {taxRates?.map((tax) => (
                               <SelectItem key={tax.id} value={tax.id}>
                                 {tax.name}
